# Learn: lesson 1 (The Throw) from the title's Learn to Play — the briefing,
# the countdown, two throws on the Space key at the widest gaps
# (`node tools/plan.mjs tut-throw`: the round clock is the runtime's fixed
# steps, one tick a frame here, so the planned score is the score), the
# results with their breakdown and achievements, then Menu and the lesson
# list showing the lesson completed.
until 300 Play
frames 300
save title
click Learn to Play
until 60 Lesson 1 — The Throw
frames 5
save lessons
click Lesson 1 — The Throw
until 60 Begin
frames 5
save setup
click Begin
# tut-throw: won (goal-complete), score 984
frames 169
key Space 2
frames 522
key Space 2
until 200 Wheel Cleared!
expect Total
expect 984
expect First Blood of Oak
frames 30
save results
click Menu
until 60 Play
frames 5
click Learn to Play
until 60 COMPLETED
